# claude-mem auto-generates empty CLAUDE.md context stubs in directories it
# touches. Inside src/pages/ they become live Astro routes; inside public/ they
# are copied verbatim into dist/. Ignore them everywhere except the two real,
# hand-maintained docs at the repo root and in docs/.
CLAUDE.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/docs/CLAUDE.md
